From: =?UTF-8?q?=C3=98yvind=20Harboe?= <oyvind.harboe@zylin.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pdn: connect the supply pins of dont_touch instances

regfile_dissolve.tcl (0089) marks the cores of dissolved register files
dont_touch at the macro step, before the PDN step defines the global
connections, and global_connect skips dont_touch instances (ODB-0383,
deliberate in odb). Their VDD and VSS pins stayed on no net through
final: 896 of riscv32i's 7,089 instances in test/regfile, 406,272 cells
on XiangShan's XSTile parent. The M1 rails touch them, so timing and
routing were unaffected; the netlist, LVS and power analysis saw them
unpowered.

Every dont_touch instance with a supply pin on no net has its dont_touch
lifted while the platform's PDN script makes its global connections,
and restored after: one connection, no ODB-0383 warning per instance
(406,272 on XSTile). A supply pin already on a net is left alone.

Not upstreamed; it goes with the regfile drafts. Retires when the
//:bump lands an ORFS that connects them (in pdn.tcl or in
regfile_dissolve.tcl).

---
 flow/scripts/pdn.tcl | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 35 insertions(+)

diff --git a/flow/scripts/pdn.tcl b/flow/scripts/pdn.tcl
index 2230e05f8..5f2a2cf86 100644
--- a/flow/scripts/pdn.tcl
+++ b/flow/scripts/pdn.tcl
@@ -3,7 +3,42 @@ erase_non_stage_variables floorplan
 load_design 2_3_floorplan_tapcell.odb 2_1_floorplan.sdc
 source_step_tcl PRE PDN
 
+# global_connect skips dont_touch instances (ODB-0383, a warning each),
+# and the cores of dissolved register files are dont_touch by now
+# (regfile_dissolve.tcl), so their supply pins were left on no net: in
+# the netlist, LVS and power analysis they were unpowered. A supply pin on
+# no net changes no logic when it is connected, so dont_touch is lifted
+# from those instances for the platform's global connections and
+# restored after. A supply pin already on a net is left alone.
+proc dont_touch_unsupplied { } {
+  set insts {}
+  foreach inst [[ord::get_db_block] getInsts] {
+    if { ![$inst isDoNotTouch] } {
+      continue
+    }
+    foreach iterm [$inst getITerms] {
+      set type [[$iterm getMTerm] getSigType]
+      if { ($type eq "POWER" || $type eq "GROUND") && [$iterm getNet] eq "NULL" } {
+        lappend insts $inst
+        break
+      }
+    }
+  }
+  return $insts
+}
+set lifted [dont_touch_unsupplied]
+foreach inst $lifted {
+  $inst setDoNotTouch 0
+}
 source $::env(PDN_TCL)
+foreach inst $lifted {
+  $inst setDoNotTouch 1
+}
+if { [llength $lifted] > 0 } {
+  utl::info FLW 18 "[llength $lifted] dont_touch instances had a supply pin\
+    on no net; connected by the global connections"
+}
+
 pdngen
 
 source_step_tcl POST PDN
